ReadIonParametersBin() (P533/Src/P533/ReadIonParameters.c:422 and :450) reads the Fortran record markers (0xff then the record length 5598912, little-endian) into buffer and never checks them, so any file of at least the right size is accepted: an all-zero ionos05.bin runs with exit 0 and reports dmax -92567 km and -307 dB sentinels. The markers should be checked and a wrong file rejected with 141. Medium.
